2026-10-09T17:56:43.6370298Z [0m
2026-10-09T17:56:43.6371128Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-10-09T17:56:43.6372035Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-10-09T17:56:43.6372432Z 
2026-10-09T17:56:43.6373716Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-10-09T17:56:43.6374862Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
