2026-10-09T17:56:43.6376635Z 
2026-10-09T17:56:43.6377117Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [30001..30008])[0m and groups [34m(gid 30000)[0m
2026-10-09T17:56:43.6377713Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-10-09T17:56:43.6378171Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-10-09T17:56:43.6378531Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-10-09T17:56:43.6378697Z 
2026-10-09T17:56:43.6378936Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-10-09T17:56:43.6379198Z 
2026-10-09T17:56:43.6379471Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-10-09T17:56:43.6379857Z    can use Nix.
2026-10-09T17:56:43.6379985Z 
2026-10-09T17:56:43.6380118Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
