2026-10-09T17:56:43.6383803Z 
2026-10-09T17:56:43.6384001Z I will:
2026-10-09T17:56:43.6384144Z 
2026-10-09T17:56:43.6384381Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-10-09T17:56:43.6384946Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-10-09T17:56:43.6385781Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-10-09T17:56:43.6386588Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-10-09T17:56:43.6386897Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-10-09T17:56:43.6387483Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-10-09T17:56:43.6402997Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-10-09T17:56:43.6403836Z    /root
2026-10-09T17:56:43.6404863Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-10-09T17:56:43.6406034Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-10-09T17:56:43.6413889Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
